-No operational nonce has been supplied, no MSI has been built, and no Windows install/query/uninstall has run. Only Python AST/CLI and in-memory table/authoring contracts are checked. The PowerShell5.1 child is prepared source and has not been parsed or executed by PowerShell here. Production N/B frozen files are unchanged; `01`/`21` matching is not modified or guessed.
